OL,3,GNEWSABarlinnie water problems continue
OL,4,Afor seventh day
OL,5,
OL,6,FParts of Barlinnie Prison are still
OL,7,Faffected by water supply issues, almost
OL,8,Fa week after problems were first
OL,9,Freported.
OL,11,FThe Scottish Prison Service told BBC
OL,12,FScotland News most areas of the prison
OL,13,Fhave now suffered disruption to the
OL,14,Fwater supply. The problems began last
OL,15,FThursday.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
