OL,3,GNEWSABarlinnie water problems continue
OL,4,Afor seventh day
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral friends or family members of
OL,7,Fprisoners have contacted the BBC to
OL,8,Freport difficulties, including days
OL,9,Fwithout hot water or even any running
OL,10,Fwater resulting in some prisoners being
OL,11,Funable to flush the toilet in their
OL,12,Fcells.
OL,14,FThe SPS said on Sunday that the water
OL,15,Fsupply had been restored but has since
OL,16,Fadmitted there is still disruption.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
